{"title":"Pickering Indoor Soccer","startsAt":"2026-11-10T22:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-11T00:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**🚨IMPORTANT UPDATE - READ BEFORE RSVPing🚨**\n\nWe’ve launched our new website: www.soccertoronto.ca **All sign‑ups must now be completed through the website.** Meetup reservations **do NOT** confirm your spot.\nThere is **no texting or emailing to sign up anymore.** All program information, registration, rules, and updates are now on the website.\n**Do NOT show up without signing up in advance — you will be turned away.**\n\n**HOW TO SIGN UP**\n👉 Register online at www.soccertoronto.ca\n👉 Payments must be sent to payment@soccertoronto.ca\n👉 For general questions only, email info@soccertoronto.ca\n\n**TORONTO’S BEST INDOOR PICKUP SOCCER**\nHosted by **Soccer Toronto** — Est. 2008\n\n**FALL/WINTER SCHEDULE**\n\n* **Tuesdays** — 10:30 PM to 12:00 AM\n\nPickup soccer runs weekly at **Pickering Soccer Centre**, **80 Conlin Road W, Oshawa, ON L1G 7W1 (Simcoe St N & Conlin Road W)**.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://maps.app.goo.gl/A8L6WDP7CCWk2aYY6\n\nWe welcome skilled regulars and new players every week. There is always a game.\n\n**PROGRAM DETAILS**\n\n* **Format:** 8v8 - 2 Fields - 5 Teams Max\n* **Level:** All players welcome (Beginner to Advanced)\n* **Cost:** **$25/player** — *payment required in advance*\n* **Payment Email:** payments@soccertoronto.ca\n* **Register Online:** www.soccertoronto.ca\n\n**WHAT TO BRING**\n\n* Indoor turf shoes (no cleats)\n* Shin guards recommended\n* Water\n* Jerseys/pinnies/balls are provided\n* Snacks & drinks available on-site\n\nMeet the organizer on the first field when you enter the facility.\n\n**REMINDER**\n\n**Meetup RSVP = NOT a confirmed spot.** Only website registrations count.\nSpace is limited — register early.","venue":{"name":"Pickering Soccer Centre","address":"1975 Clements Rd, Pickering, ON L1W 4C2, Canada, Pickering","lat":43.826725,"lng":-79.049444,"city":"Pickering"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Soccer Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/7/9/2/highres_536275186.jpeg"}